	(text "SHEETS\n2  pwr_input - 5 V input connectors J6, J4\n3  pwr_vcore - VCORE buck U15 (TPS548A28)\n4  pwr_rails - 1V8/3V3/1V2/1V1 bucks, 3V3_analog LDO U6, power good\n5  soc_power - U7 power pins and decoupling\n6  soc_gnd - U7 ground pins\n7  soc_config - SDM: MSEL, nCONFIG/nSTATUS, QSPI flash U2\n8  clocks - 25 MHz and 100 MHz oscillators\n9  hps_io - U7 HPS I/O\n10 IOBANK 3 - bank 3A LPDDR4 controller\n11 lpddr4 memory - U12 LPDDR4 and decoupling\n12 hps_emmc - eMMC U11\n13 hps_ethernet - RTL8211FDI PHY U10, RJ45 J9\n14 debug_status - JTAG J1, HPS UART J10, FPGA UART J2, LEDs\n15 fpga_bank2a - bank 2A\n16-19 fpga_bank6ab/cd/ef/gh - HVIO banks 6A-6H\n20 adc - ADS7056, input mux, rail monitor\n21 io_headers - I/O headers J3, J5, pull-downs\n\nIOBANK 3 and lpddr4 memory keep their names: the LPDDR4\nlength rules and scripts match /IOBANK 3/ net names."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
